     D AM              S              9  2 DIM(12)
     D*
     D*  THE FOLLOWING  8 ARRAYS SPLIT AMOUNTS FOR ANNIV RATING
     D*  SO THAT INCREASED LIMITS CAN BE APPLIED CORRECTLY
     D*  PDAT - DATES IN WHICH PAYROLLS TAKE ON DIFFERENT RATING
     D*  RDAT - CORRESPONDING RATES IN EFFECT FOR PAYROLLS AS OF PDAT
     D*  PRO  - PRORATA FOR EACH RATING PERIOD - NEED THIS IN ORDER TO
     D*         SPLIT EMP PAYROLLS (WMEPP) CORRECTLY.
     D*
     D*
     D PDAT            S              7  0 DIM(6) ASCEND                        PAYROLL DATES
     D RDAT            S              7  0 DIM(6) ASCEND                        RATING DATES
     D FDAT            S              7  0 DIM(6) ASCEND                        RATING DATES
     D PRO             S              5  4 DIM(6)                               PRORATA
      *** Beg Add ***** 11/13/24 *********************************************
     D PRO2            S              5  4 DIM(6)                               PRORATA
      *** End Add ***** 11/13/24 *********************************************
     D RDEV            S              5  4 DIM(6)                               MA DIA DEV RATES
