     C                   Z-ADD     XXARP1        MPRPE1
     C                   Z-ADD     XXARP2        MPRPE2
     C                   Z-ADD     XXARP3        MPRPE3
     C*** begin add ***  11/07/23  **************************************
     C* Balance to minimum
     C                   If        ELEmnp = 'Y'
     C*** begin chg ***  11/08/24  ****************************************
     C******             Eval      MPEBal = xxHigh - xxwkcm
     C                   Eval      MPEBal = xxHigh - xxActp
     C*** end chg *****  11/08/24  ****************************************
     C                   Else
     C                   Eval      MPEBal = 0
     C                   Endif
     C*** end add *****  11/07/23  **************************************
     C*** Beg Add *****  02/27/24  **************************************
     C                   Eval      MPSRAM = ELSRAM
     C*** End Add *****  02/27/24  **************************************
     C                   Update    pmp01
     C                   Endif
     C*** end add *****  06/15/23  **************************************
     C************************************************************
     C*  PRORATE MINIMUM PREMIUM
     C*
     C                   XFOOT(H)  LM            XLWK11           11 0
