     C                   Z-ADD     XSMAN         ELMAPR
     C                   XFOOT(H)  WAV           XXWK10
     C                   Z-ADD     XXWK10        ELEWAV
     C                   Z-ADD     XXNET         ELANPR
     C                   Eval      ELepf = xxEPF
     C                   Z-ADD     XXPAYR        ELETER
     C                   Z-ADD     XXEDTR        ELEDTR
     C                   XFOOT     PAY           XXAMT1
     C                   XFOOT     PAY2          XXTOTL
     C                   ADD       XXAMT1        XXTOTL
     C                   DIV(H)    100           XXTOTL
     C                   IF        XXTOTL > 0
     C     ELETER        DIV(H)    XXTOTL        ELTERR
     C                   ENDIF
     C                   XFOOT     PAY           XXTOTL
     C                   DIV(H)    100           XXTOTL
     C                   IF        XXTOTL > 0
     C     ELEDTR        DIV(H)    XXTOTL        ELDTRR
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* If LCM is excluded from terrorism rates then load directly
     C* from Stat Rpt/Rating when only one rate is being applied.
     C*
     C                   If        RRTerL = 'Y'
     C* Foreign Terrorism
     C                   If        (pyTrt(1) <> 0 and pyTrt(2) = 0
     C                             and (npTrt(1) = 0 or npTrt(1) = pyTrt(1)
     C                              or %xfoot(nTr) = 0))
     C                             or (pyTrt(1) <> 0 and pyTrt(2) = pyTrt(1)
     C                             and (npTrt(1) = 0 or npTrt(1) = pyTrt(1)
     C                              or %xfoot(nTr) = 0))
     C                   Z-add     pyTrt(1)      ELTERR
     C                   Endif
     C* Domestic Terrorism
     C                   If        (dmTrt(1) <> 0 and dmTrt(2) = 0) or
     C                             (dmTrt(1) <> 0 and dmTrt(2) = dmTrt(1))
     C                   Z-add     dmTrt(1)      ELDTRR
     C                   Endif
     C*
     C                   Endif
     C                   Z-ADD(H)  XXSTAN        XXWK10
     C                   Z-ADD     XXWK10        ELSTPR
     C                   Z-ADD(H)  XXNORM        XXWK10
