     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C                   XFOOT     SUB           XXPREM           15 4
     C*
     C     XXPREM        IFNE      ELESBJ
     C     ELESBJ        SUB       XXPREM        XXPREM
     C                   ADD       XXPREM        SUB(1)
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C                   XFOOT     MOD           XXPREM           15 4
     C*
     C     XXPREM        IFNE      ELEMPM
     C     ELEMPM        SUB       XXPREM        XXPREM
     C                   ADD       XXPREM        MOD(1)
     C                   ENDIF
