     C*
     C     IFIFBL        IFNE      *BLANKS
     C     IFIFEE        ANDNE     *ZERO
     C     BSSEFL        ANDEQ     'E'
      * If ELIFFL flag is set to 'Y' or the IFEXPD date exists and  policy
      * effective date is after IFEXPD, do not bill the installment fees
     C     ELIFFL        ANDEQ     *BLANK
      *
     C     IFEXPD        IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C     IFEXPD        ORNE      *ZEROS
     C     ELPFDT        ANDLT     IFEXPD
      *
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     IFIFEE        XXINSB
     C                   MOVE      IFIFBL        XXIFBL
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  IFEXPD IFNE
     C                   ENDIF                                                  IFIFBL IFNE
     C*
     C* IF SUMMARY THEN ONLY CHARGE INSTALLMENT FEES ONCE.
     C*
     C     XXAR          IFEQ      ' '
     C     EMSTRP        ANDEQ     'Y'
     C                   ADD       XXINSB        XTINSB
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C     XXSUM         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   Z-ADD     XTINSB        XXINSB
