     C     XXINSB        IFNE      *ZERO
     C     XXIFBL        ANDNE     *BLANKS
     C     XXNET1        ANDNE     *ZERO
     C*
     C*  THE INSTALLMENT FEES WILL BE BILLED TO EACH INSTALLMENT AFTER
     C*  THE FIRST ONE.
     C*
     C     BSDOWK        IFEQ      *BLANKS
     C     BSFREQ        ANDNE     'T'
     C*
     C* BILL TO A/R FROM INSTALLMENT BUCKETS.
     C*
     C                   MOVE      ELBSDT        XXPFDT
     C                   MOVEL     XXDATE        YYMM2             5 0
     C                   Z-ADD     1             L
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        XXAMT2
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         AM
     C     1             DO        12            X
     C     AB(X)         IFNE      *ZERO
     C     X             ANDNE     1
     C     L             ANDNE     1
     C                   Z-ADD     XXINSB        XXAMT2
     C                   ENDIF
     C     YYMM          IFGE      YYMM2
     C                   Z-ADD     XXAMT2        AM(L)
     C                   ADD       1             L
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        XXAMT2
     C                   ENDIF                                                  YYMM IFGE
     C                   ADD       1             MM
     C     MM            IFGT      12
     C                   Z-ADD     1             MM
     C                   ADD       1             YY
     C                   ENDIF                                                  MM > 12
     C                   ENDDO                                                  DO X 12
     C*
     C*  WRITE THE INSTALLMENT FEE AMOUNTS.
     C*
     C                   MOVE      TRYM          YYMM              5 0
      *
     C     1             DO        12            L
      *
     C     AM(L)         IFNE      *ZERO
      *
     C     L             IFEQ      1
     C                   MOVE      XXDATE        EAPODT
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVE      XXPFDT        EAPODT
